The pauses.json file contains the pauses (waqfs and/or gaps) in the Dar-ul-Ma‘refa
Muṣħaf (the muṣħaf whose pages' images are included in this directory).

The morepauses.json file provides more break points for the really long phrases
that our Muṣħaf doesn't break (usually more than two lines).

These additional pauses are based on muṣħafs of Maghreb and Turkey and Indo-Pak,
but not every waqf in them is taken (Turkey and Indo-Pak are very similar in
their waqfs), but almost all waqfs existing in both Eastern (Turkey & Indo-Pak)
and Western (Maghreb) muṣħafs are taken.

Maghreb:
- LY: https://archive.org/details/MushafQal467964694669669oonLibya
- DZ: https://archive.org/details/ALSHTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTARSH

Turkey:
- https://archive.org/details/Quran_Hussen
- https://archive.org/details/musha34734734747f-nory

Indo-Pak:
- https://archive.org/details/AlQuran15LinesPakistaniPrintBlack
- https://archive.org/details/15-lined-saudi

It's still a work-in-progress.

Current state: done till the end of Sura 4 (An-Nisā’), ie, pages 1-105.
